On-shots remain in play until their entire text has resolved (including the next played card)

&nbsp;

So Infinitor plays a one-shot, which plays another one-shot, etc etc until every one-shot in is deck has been played. &nbsp;Then he shuffles the trash and continues playing one-shots until the deck is empty again. &nbsp;Then he reshuffles again. &nbsp;But now the trash is empty so the deck stays empty, he can&#39;t do anything, and he fails to play a card. &nbsp;Then all the one-shots resolve and are put in the trash.

&nbsp;

No errata is needed.

&nbsp;

